A '''Honeyhog''' is a {{Mt|Critter}} that can be spawned by applying Honey to [[Fig Tree]]s on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Honeyhog''' has a {{Chance|50%|1|2}} chance to spawn after applying a {{Item|Fun-Sized Pot of Honeycomb|text=Fun-Sized}}, {{Item|Family-Sized Pot of Honeycomb|text=Family-Sized}}, {{Item|Jumbo Pot of Honeycomb|text=Jumbo}}, or {{Item|Behemoth Pot of Honeycomb}} to a [[Fig Tree]] with a [[Tree Protection Order]].

== Behavior ==
A '''Honeyhog''' walks around on the ground by default. If the player throws a [[Lasso]] at it, it begins to charge towards them. If the '''Honeyhog''' touches the player, it breaks the [[Lasso]] and sends the following message:
{{Dialogue|&cThe &fHoneyhog &cbroke free from your lasso!}}

Reeling in the '''Honeyhog''' captures it.

